---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "I wasted ₹1200 on a bad mic. Don't do same. - SetupKaro";
const desc = "Real testing. Real room. No specs copy-paste.";
---
<Layout title={title} desc={desc} crumbs={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Guides',href:'/#tools'},{label:'Best Mic'}]}>
<main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
<div class="dk-card mt-4 p-6 sm:p-8" style="background:#fffdf7">
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500">By Noyel G • Updated 6 Sept 2026 • Fan on, window open, Realme phone</div>
<h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mt-1">I wasted ₹1200 on a bad mic.<br/>Don't do same.</h1>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Real testing. Real room. No specs copy-paste.</p>

<div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-100 via-orange-100 to-gray-800 min-h-[180px] flex items-end">
<div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center text-7xl">🎙️</div>
<div class="absolute top-4 right-6 text-white font-handwriting italic text-lg rotate-3">Clear audio.<br/>Simple setup.</div>
<div class="relative bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent w-full p-4 pt-10"></div>
</div>

<p class="text-sm leading-7 mt-4">Last year I bought a ₹499 "condenser" from Amazon. 4,000 ratings, 4.3 stars. Sounded like I was recording inside a pressure cooker — fan + auto outside, my voice thin. Returned in 3 days.</p>
<p class="text-sm leading-7 mt-2">After that I borrowed 3 mics from friends, bought 2 myself. Below is what actually worked in my room — fan on, window open, Realme phone.</p>

<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4 mt-4 bg-[#f8f9fb]">
<div class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600">My recommendation</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-1">
<div><div class="font-bold">Boya BY-M1</div><div class="text-sm font-semibold">₹893 <span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-500">(goes 850–999)</span></div><div class="text-xs text-gray-500">6m wire, no battery tension, clear voice even with fan on.</div></div>
<a href="#" rel="nofollow sponsored" class="text-xl">→</a>
</div>
</div>
<p class="text-sm leading-7 mt-3"><b>K8 Wireless?</b> Used friend's for 2 days in market. Freedom, but slight delay on my old Vivo and robotic voice in silent room. Buy only for walking videos — for room videos Boya is clearer + ₹600 cheaper.</p>
<p class="text-sm leading-7 mt-2"><b>Skip:</b> ₹500 no-name wireless (auto horn louder than voice — my ₹1200 mistake), Fifine K669B unless desk + curtains (echo in concrete room).</p>

<div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-4 mt-4 text-sm leading-7">
<b>3 settings that mattered more than mic:</b> mic 15cm from mouth (one fist) • Realme/Xiaomi: OTG on, Open Camera app for wired • fan at 1, window closed beats costly mic.
</div>
<p class="text-sm mt-4">Tools: <a href="/tools/youtube-setup-under-5000" class="text-indigo-700 font-bold">Budget builder →</a> | <a href="/tools/freelance-rate-calculator" class="text-indigo-700 font-bold">Rate calculator →</a></p>
</div>
</main>
</Layout>
